# Rosetta Code: https://rosettacode.org/wiki/99_bottles_of_beer
# R: for(i in 99:1) { cat(i, "bottles..."); ... }
99D"L MD1=?'1 bottle'}M1=~?Ma' bottles'C}' of beer on the wall, 'Cp MD1=?'1 bottle'}M1=~?Ma' bottles'C}' of beer.'Cp'Take one down and pass it around, 'p M1-L MD0=?'No more bottles'}M0=~?MD1=?'1 bottle'}M1=~?Ma' bottles'C}}' of beer on the wall.'Cp''p M"x
